60	    /// difference - this is given by `regions.may_progress()`. Otherwise, it
61	    /// is set to `Some(false)`, which is usually the case when the first
62	    /// sticky block in the group is at the very top of the page (then,
63	    /// migrating it would just lead us back to the top of the page, leading
64	    /// to an infinite loop). In that case, all sticky blocks of the group are
65	    /// also disabled, until this is reset to `None` on the first non-sticky
66	    /// frame we find.
